# Arise Church — Complete Site Map
**Every one of the 49 routes, assigned a home.** Nothing left unplaced.

---

## The navigation

```
I'M NEW        → Plan Your Visit · Beliefs · Promises
ABOUT          → Our Story · Our Leaders · Our Campuses
MINISTRIES     → Children's · Youth · Outreach · Lead Network
                 (+ Thrive · Mvmt 6:14 · Worship · In Edge/X Edge — coming soon)
MEDIA          → Past Sermons · Podcast · Devotional · Training · Bible Search
EVENTS         → Upcoming · Previous Events
GET INVOLVED   → Serve · Classes
[ GIVE ]         (button → Tithe.ly)
```

Six menu items plus one button. Everything below reaches from one of them.

---

## 1. Pages in the main navigation (14)

| Page | Current URL | Goes under | Change |
|---|---|---|---|
| Home | `/` | — | — |
| About | `/about` | ABOUT → Our Story | — |
| Meet our Leaders | `/leaders` | ABOUT → Our Leaders | — |
| Ministries | `/ministries` | MINISTRIES (landing) | — |
| Children's Ministry | `/childrens` | MINISTRIES | — |
| Youth Ministry | `/youth` | MINISTRIES | — |
| Outreach | `/outreach` | MINISTRIES | **needs content** |
| Lead Network | `/general-4` | MINISTRIES | **→ `/lead-network`** |
| Past Sermons | `/sermons` | MEDIA | — |
| Bible Search | `/arise-bible` | MEDIA | moved out of top level |
| Events | `/events` | EVENTS | — |
| Previous Events | `/previous-events-1` | EVENTS | **→ `/past-events`** |
| Sign Up to Serve! | `/serve` | GET INVOLVED | moved out of Contact |
| Contact | `/contact` | footer + I'M NEW | — |

---

## 2. Live pages with no home today (7)

These exist, work, and nothing links to them.

| Page | Current URL | Goes under | Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Training** | `/s-projects-basic` | MEDIA → Training | **Rename to `/training`.** Two full Bible studies hiding on a Wix template slug. |
| **Podcast** | `/podcast` | MEDIA → Podcast | Redirect isn't firing — it renders the word "Spotify". Fix the redirect. |
| **Devotional** | `/devotional` | MEDIA → Devotional | Empty. Content or unpublish. |
| **Beliefs** | popup `zrgdv` | I'M NEW → Beliefs | Keep as popup, also link from I'M NEW. |
| **Promises** | popup `iq9bz` | I'M NEW → Promises | Same. |
| **Give** | `/tithes-and-offerings` | GIVE button | Keep — it's your livestream/social short link. |
| **Classes** | `/challenges` | GET INVOLVED → Classes | You didn't know this existed. Decide: use or uninstall. |

---

## 3. New pages the rebuild needs (2)

| Page | URL | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Plan Your Visit** | `/plan-your-visit` | Times, campuses, parking, dress code, arrive early. Every one of your four reference sites leads with this. Copy is already written. |
| **Our Campuses** | `/campuses` | Nothing on the site says you're one church in two locations. |

---

## 4. App pages — no menu entry, reached in flow (16)

Normal and correct. They appear when someone books, buys, or logs in.

**Bookings:** `/book-online` · `/booking-calendar` · `/booking-form` · `/service-page` · `/inquiry-services-page`
**Stores:** `/product-page` · `/cart-page` · `/checkout` · `/side-cart` (popup) · `/payment-request-page` · `/thank-you-page`
**Members:** `/profile` · `/notifications` · `/account-settings` · `/my-orders` · `/my-bookings`

> ⚠️ **`/thank-you-page` still has Wix demo data live** — "Product option 1/2/3", "$0.00", and an outbound link to `kamille.info`. Clear it.

---

## 5. Online Programs pages (5)

All belong to the `/challenges` app you didn't recognise.

`/challenge-page` · `/challenge-payment` · `/challenge-thanks` · `/participant-page` · `/my-programs`

**One decision covers all five:** use Online Programs, or uninstall it and these disappear.

---

## 6. Remove or fix (5)

| Page | URL | Action |
|---|---|---|
| **Events (duplicate)** | `/events-2` | **Unpublish.** Empty duplicate of Events. |
| **Home (duplicate)** | `/home` | Duplicate route to `/`. Remove one. |
| **Job Board** | `/job-board` | **Unpublish** until hiring is announced. |
| **Application Form** | `/application-form` | Empty and orphaned. What was it for? |
| **Schedule** | `/schedule` | Renders "No Schedule to display". Content or unpublish. |
| **Information Desk** | `/information-desk-registration` | Keep password-protected, but **remove from the header and footer** — it's linked 70 times sitewide. |
| **Event Details** | `/events-1` | Wix Events detail template. Keep, no menu entry. |

---

## Tally

| | |
|---|---|
| In the main menu | 14 |
| Surfaced from hiding | 7 |
| New pages to build | 2 |
| App flow pages (no menu) | 16 |
| Online Programs (one decision) | 5 |
| Unpublish or fix | 7 |
| **Total accounted for** | **51** |

---

## Decisions I need from you

1. **Online Programs** — use `/challenges` or uninstall? Removes six pages either way.
2. **`/application-form`** — what was it for?
3. **`/schedule`** — content, or unpublish?
4. **Devotional** — make it real, or unpublish?
5. **Podcast redirect** — was it ever set up?
6. Confirm the URL renames: `/general-4` → `/lead-network`, `/s-projects-basic` → `/training`, `/previous-events-1` → `/past-events`. **All three need 301 redirects** so existing links don't break.
=================== PAGES-CHECKLIST ===================
# Pages Checklist

Everything you need to create, keep, or remove. Tick as you go.

---

## Pages that already exist — add the element

Keep the page and its URL. Delete the old content, add one Custom Element, stretch it full width.

| Page | URL | File | Tag name |
|---|---|---|---|
| Home | `/` | `arise-home.js` | `arise-home` |
| About | `/about` | `arise-about.js` | `arise-about` |
| Meet our Leaders | `/leaders` | `arise-leaders.js` | `arise-leaders` |
| Ministries | `/ministries` | `arise-ministries.js` | `arise-ministries` |
| Past Sermons | `/sermons` | `arise-sermons.js` | `arise-sermons` |
| Events | `/events` | `arise-events.js` | `arise-events` |
| Contact | `/contact` | `arise-contact.js` | `arise-contact` |
| Bible Search | `/arise-bible` | `arise-bible.js` | `arise-bible` |

**Eight pages. Eight files. Nothing new to create.**

> **Contact:** keep your native Wix form. Place it under the "Send Us a Message" heading inside the element. A custom element can't submit to Wix Forms.

---

## Pages to CREATE — two

| Page | URL | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Plan Your Visit** | `/plan-your-visit` | Optional. The Home hero currently scrolls to What To Expect, which covers parking, attire and arrival. Only build this if you want it as its own page. |
| **Our Campuses** | `/campuses` | Optional. Both campuses already appear on Home and Contact. Build it if you want a dedicated page. |

**Neither is required.** Both subjects are already covered. Create them only if you want the menu entries.

---

## Pages to RENAME — three

Pages → ⋮ → SEO Basics → URL slug. **Wix offers a 301 redirect — say yes every time.**

| From | To |
|---|---|
| `/general-4` | `/lead-network` |
| `/s-projects-basic` | `/training` |
| `/previous-events-1` | `/past-events` |

> After renaming, update `arise-home.js` (Lead Network tile) and `arise-events.js` (Previous Events link). Tell me when they're done and I'll send corrected files.

---

## Pages to UNPUBLISH — four

`/application-form` · `/schedule` · `/devotional` · `/events-2`

Empty, duplicated, or abandoned.

---

## Uninstall Online Programs

Dashboard → Apps → Manage Apps → **Online Programs → Uninstall.**

Removes six pages at once: `/challenges`, `/challenge-page`, `/challenge-payment`, `/challenge-thanks`, `/participant-page`, `/my-programs`.

---

## Pages to KEEP as they are

| Page | Why |
|---|---|
| `/serve` | Wix form, works. Restyle later. |
| `/childrens` `/youth` `/outreach` | Small pages, low traffic. Elements later if you want. |
| `/general-4` (Lead Network) | Rename, then leave |
| `/s-projects-basic` (Training) | Rename, then leave |
| `/previous-events-1` | Rename, then leave |
| `/tithes-and-offerings` | Your Give short link |
| `/podcast` | Already redirects to Spotify correctly |
| `/job-board` | Unpublish until you're hiring |
| `/information-desk-registration` | Keep password-protected. **Remove it from the header and footer** — it's linked 70 times sitewide. |

---

## Fix while you're in there

**`/thank-you-page`** still has Wix demo data live — "Product option 1/2/3", "$0.00", and an outbound link to `kamille.info`, a domain unconnected to you. Delete those elements.

**Homepage needs native Wix text** — an H1 and both campus addresses, as real Wix text elements. Custom element content isn't in the server HTML, so Google currently sees an empty homepage. **This is the most important item on this list.**

---

## Order I'd do it in

1. **Native text on the homepage** — 15 minutes, closes the SEO gap
2. **The eight elements** — one page per sitting
3. **Contact form positioning**
4. Three renames, four unpublishes, uninstall Online Programs
5. Clean the thank-you page, fix the header/footer link
6. Decide on Plan Your Visit and Campuses

---

## Backend files

| File | For | Required? |
|---|---|---|
| `backend/youtube.jsw` | Sermons — live detection + series | Optional. Sermons works without it. |
| `backend/events.jsw` | Events — real event data | **Yes**, for correct images and buttons |
| `backend/bibleApis.jsw` | Bible Search | **Delete once `arise-bible` is live** — the element calls the API itself |

Page code needed on: **Sermons** and **Events** only. Every other page needs none.
=================== ALL-PAGE-CODE ===================
# Arise Church — All Velo Page Code
**Copy each block into its file. One at a time.**

---

## ⚠️ READ THIS FIRST — two pages you must NOT overwrite

**Bible Search (`/arise-bible`)** runs your own custom Velo code — the Bible reference tool. **I have not written a replacement and you should not paste anything into it.** Leave that file exactly as it is.

**Any page where you've already written working code** — same rule. Check before pasting. If a file has code you wrote, tell me and I'll merge rather than replace.

---

## The rule that caused today's errors

| File type | What's allowed |
|---|---|
| `masterPage.js` and page code | **Only** `$w` and `wix-*` imports. Runs server-side first. |
| `public/custom-elements/` | Anything with `HTMLElement`, `customElements.define`, `document.*`, `window.*` |

`document is not defined` or `HTMLElement is not defined` **always** means a file is in the wrong place.

---

## 1. masterPage.js

Site-wide. Replace everything currently in it.

```javascript
// masterPage.js — site-wide code for Arise Church
// Runs on the SERVER first, then in the browser.
// No document, no window, no DOM APIs. $w only.
// Custom elements belong in public/custom-elements/

$w.onReady(() => {
  // Nothing site-wide yet.
});
```

---

## 2. Home

Drives the ministries strip from the CMS. The `.length` guards mean it's safe to paste before the repeater exists.

```javascript
// Home — page code
import wixData from 'wix-data';

$w.onReady(async () => {
  if (!$w('#homeMinRepeater').length) return;

  try {
    const { items } = await wixData.query('Ministries')
      .eq('comingSoon', false)
      .ascending('sortOrder')
      .limit(4)
      .find();

    $w('#homeMinRepeater').onItemReady(($item, m) => {
      if ($item('#hmTitle').length) $item('#hmTitle').text = m.title || '';
      if ($item('#hmCat').length)   $item('#hmCat').text   = m.category || '';
      if ($item('#hmImage').length && m.image) {
        $item('#hmImage').src = m.image;
        $item('#hmImage').alt = m.title || 'Arise Church ministry';
      }
    });

    $w('#homeMinRepeater').data = items;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Home ministries load failed:', err);
  }
});
```

---

## 3. Meet our Leaders

Six leaders already in the CMS. The Sanders are flagged `featured` and get the wide card.

```javascript
// Meet our Leaders — page code
import wixData from 'wix-data';

$w.onReady(async () => {
  try {
    // Featured couple — Apostle Bryant & Pastor Vanessa Sanders
    if ($w('#featName').length) {
      const f = await wixData.query('Leaders').eq('featured', true).limit(1).find();
      if (f.items.length) {
        const lead = f.items[0];
        $w('#featName').text = lead.name || '';
        if ($w('#featRole').length)  $w('#featRole').text = lead.role || '';
        if ($w('#featBio').length)   $w('#featBio').text  = lead.bio  || '';
        if ($w('#featPhoto').length && lead.photo) {
          $w('#featPhoto').src = lead.photo;
          $w('#featPhoto').alt = lead.name || 'Arise Church leader';
        }
      }
    }

    // Everyone else
    if (!$w('#leaderRepeater').length) return;

    const featured = $w('#featName').length;   // exclude the Sanders if featured above
    let q = wixData.query('Leaders').ascending('sortOrder');
    if (featured) q = q.eq('featured', false);
    const { items } = await q.limit(50).find();

    $w('#leaderRepeater').onItemReady(($item, l) => {
      if ($item('#leaderName').length) $item('#leaderName').text = l.name || '';
      if ($item('#leaderRole').length) $item('#leaderRole').text = l.role || '';
      if ($item('#leaderBio').length)  $item('#leaderBio').text  = l.bio  || '';
      if ($item('#leaderPhoto').length) {
        if (l.photo) {
          $item('#leaderPhoto').src = l.photo;
          $item('#leaderPhoto').alt = l.name || 'Arise Church leader';
          $item('#leaderPhoto').show();
        } else {
          $item('#leaderPhoto').collapse();
        }
      }
    });

    $w('#leaderRepeater').data = items;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Leaders load failed:', err);
  }
});
```

---

## 4. Ministries

All eight. The four without pages get a **Coming Soon** badge and no link — driven by the `comingSoon` field, not by layout.

```javascript
// Ministries — page code
import wixData from 'wix-data';
import wixLocationFrontend from 'wix-location-frontend';

$w.onReady(async () => {
  if (!$w('#minRepeater').length) return;

  try {
    const { items } = await wixData.query('Ministries')
      .ascending('sortOrder')
      .limit(50)
      .find();

    $w('#minRepeater').onItemReady(($item, m) => {
      if ($item('#minTitle').length)    $item('#minTitle').text    = m.title || '';
      if ($item('#minCategory').length) $item('#minCategory').text = m.category || '';
      if ($item('#minImage').length && m.image) {
        $item('#minImage').src = m.image;
        $item('#minImage').alt = m.title || 'Arise Church ministry';
      }

      if (m.comingSoon) {
        if ($item('#minBadge').length) {
          $item('#minBadge').text = 'Coming Soon';
          $item('#minBadge').show();
        }
        if ($item('#minLink').length) $item('#minLink').hide();
      } else {
        if ($item('#minBadge').length) $item('#minBadge').hide();
        if ($item('#minLink').length) {
          $item('#minLink').show();
          $item('#minLink').onClick(() => {
            if (m.pageLink) wixLocationFrontend.to(m.pageLink);
          });
        }
      }
    });

    $w('#minRepeater').data = items;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Ministries load failed:', err);
  }
});
```

---

## 5. Training

Both Bible studies. The Watch button hides itself until you add a `videoUrl` in the CMS.

```javascript
// Training — page code
import wixData from 'wix-data';

$w.onReady(async () => {
  if (!$w('#studyRepeater').length) return;

  try {
    const { items } = await wixData.query('Studies')
      .ascending('sortOrder')
      .limit(50)
      .find();

    $w('#studyRepeater').onItemReady(($item, s) => {
      if ($item('#studyTitle').length)   $item('#studyTitle').text   = s.title || '';
      if ($item('#studySpeaker').length) $item('#studySpeaker').text = s.speaker || '';
      if ($item('#studyDesc').length)    $item('#studyDesc').text    = s.description || '';
      if ($item('#studyImage').length && s.image) {
        $item('#studyImage').src = s.image;
        $item('#studyImage').alt = s.title || 'Arise Church Bible study';
      }
      if ($item('#studyBtn').length) {
        if (s.videoUrl) {
          $item('#studyBtn').link = s.videoUrl;
          $item('#studyBtn').target = '_blank';
          $item('#studyBtn').show();
        } else {
          $item('#studyBtn').hide();
        }
      }
    });

    $w('#studyRepeater').data = items;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Studies load failed:', err);
  }
});
```

---

## 6. Previous Events

The `PastEvents` collection is **empty** — you haven't told me which of the fourteen past events to surface. This code works the moment you do.

```javascript
// Previous Events — page code
import wixData from 'wix-data';

$w.onReady(async () => {
  if (!$w('#eventRepeater').length) return;

  try {
    const { items } = await wixData.query('PastEvents')
      .ascending('sortOrder')
      .limit(50)
      .find();

    if (!items.length) {
      if ($w('#eventRepeater').length) $w('#eventRepeater').collapse();
      if ($w('#eventsEmpty').length)   $w('#eventsEmpty').show();
      return;
    }
    if ($w('#eventsEmpty').length) $w('#eventsEmpty').hide();

    $w('#eventRepeater').onItemReady(($item, e) => {
      if ($item('#evTitle').length) $item('#evTitle').text = e.title || '';
      if ($item('#evImage').length && e.image) {
        $item('#evImage').src = e.image;
        $item('#evImage').alt = e.title || 'Arise Church event';
      }
      if ($item('#evLink').length && e.pageLink) $item('#evLink').link = e.pageLink;
    });

    $w('#eventRepeater').data = items;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Past events load failed:', err);
  }
});
```

---

## 7. Pages that need NO code

Leave these empty. Their content is native Wix elements or Wix apps.

```javascript
$w.onReady(() => {});
```

**About · Contact · Events · Past Sermons · Serve · Children's Ministry · Youth Ministry · Outreach · Lead Network · Devotional · Podcast · Schedule**

If any already has code you wrote, **leave it** and tell me — I'll merge instead of replace.

---

## 8. Custom elements — a different folder entirely

These are **not** page code. They go in `public/custom-elements/`:

| File | Tag name |
|---|---|
| `arise-service-times.js` | `arise-service-times` |
| `arise-hero.js` | `arise-hero` |

More section files to come, all to the same folder.

---

## Order to do this in

1. **masterPage.js** — paste the four-line version. Kills `document is not defined`.
2. **Home** — paste section 2. Kills `HTMLElement is not defined`.
3. **Move the Service Times code** out of Home and into `public/custom-elements/arise-service-times.js`.
4. **Add `arise-hero.js`** to the same folder.
5. **Save.** Console should be clean.
6. Paste the remaining page files as you build each page — they do nothing until the repeaters exist, so pasting early is harmless.

---

## Element IDs the code expects

Set these in **Properties** (right-click element → View Properties). If an ID doesn't match, that element is silently skipped — no error, just nothing.

**Home:** `homeMinRepeater` · `hmTitle` · `hmCat` · `hmImage`

**Leaders:** `leaderRepeater` · `leaderName` · `leaderRole` · `leaderBio` · `leaderPhoto` · `featName` · `featRole` · `featBio` · `featPhoto`

**Ministries:** `minRepeater` · `minTitle` · `minCategory` · `minImage` · `minBadge` · `minLink`

**Training:** `studyRepeater` · `studyTitle` · `studySpeaker` · `studyDesc` · `studyImage` · `studyBtn`

**Previous Events:** `eventRepeater` · `evTitle` · `evImage` · `evLink` · `eventsEmpty`

