# Method: Bulk Insert Data Items
# Method link: https://dev.wix.com/docs/api-reference/business-solutions/cms/data-items/bulk-insert-data-items
# Method API Endpoint: POST https://www.wixapis.com/wix-data/v2/bulk/items/insert
## Method Code Examples

--- Code Example: Bulk insert new items and return inserted items ---

### Bulk insert new items and return inserted items
```javascript
curl -X POST \
'https://www.wixapis.com/wix-data/v2/bulk/items/insert' \
-H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
-H 'Authorization: <AUTH>' \
-d '{
    "dataCollectionId": "cities",
    "dataItems": [
        {
            "data": {
                "state": "California",
                "year": 2022,
                "city": "Los Angeles",
                "population": 3800000
            }
