# Package: onlinePrograms
# Namespace: programs
# Method: Create Program
# Method link: https://dev.wix.com/docs/api-reference/business-management/online-programs/programs/create-program
# Method API Endpoint: POST https://www.wixapis.com/online-programs/v3/programs
## Method Code Examples

--- Code Example: Create a paid draft program ---

### Create a paid draft program
Creates a paid, self-paced draft program. The service populates the price currency from Site Properties.

```javascript
curl -X POST \
'https://www.wixapis.com/online-programs/v3/programs' \
-H 'Authorization: <AUTH>' \
-H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
-d '{
  "program": {
    "description": {
      "title": "30-Day Wellness Challenge",
      "details": "A guided program with daily activities and progress tracking."
    },
    "timeline": {
      "selfPaced": true
    },
    "restrictions": {
      "accessType": "PUBLIC",
      "hideFutureSteps": false,
      "resolveStepsInOrder": true,
      "shareProgress": true,
      "maxParticipants": 200
    },
    "price": {
      "value": "25.00"
    },
    "seo": {
      "slug": "30-day-wellness-challenge",
      "imageAlt": "People stretching outdoors"
    },
    "videoStepsSettings": {
      "autoNavigate": true,
      "requiredCompletionPercentage": 80
    },
    "shouldSendInvoice": true
  }
}'
```
--- Method Response Shape ---

## Method Response Shape

```json
{
  "program": {
    "id": "string<GUID>",
    "revision": "string<int64>",
    "createdDate": "string<date-time>",
    "updatedDate": "string<date-time>",
    "status": "string",
    "statusUpdatedDate": "string<date-time>",
    "categoryIds": [
      "string"
    ],
    "description": {
      "oneOf": [
        "media"
      ]
    },
    "timeline": "object",
    "restrictions": "object",
    "price": "object",
    "seo": "object",
    "rewards": [
      "Reward"
    ],
    "socialGroupId": "string<GUID>",
    "extendedFields": "object",
    "shouldSendInvoice": "boolean",
    "videoStepsSettings": "object",
    "contentSummary": "object",
    "ownerUserId": "string<GUID>"
  }
}
```

--- Method Description ---
## Method Description:
Creates a draft program.

The service sets the program ID, revision, creation dates, owner, and initial
`DRAFT` status. Publish the program when it's ready to be visible
according to its access restrictions.
## Method Permissions:
ONLINE_PROGRAMS.PROGRAM_CREATE
## Method Permissions Scopes:
Manage Online Programs: SCOPE.CHALLENGES.MANAGE
## Additional Method Code Examples

--- Code Example: HTTP request example ---

### HTTP request example
```javascript
(async () => {
  const response = await fetch("https://www.wixapis.com/online-programs/v3/programs", {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "Cookie": "automation=true",
      "authorization": "appToken..."
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      "program": {
        "description": {
          "image": {
            "id": "02a1588a-fce7-485e-8eb6-8b219ae3ab2d",
            "url": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/503ea4_ed9a38760ae04aab86b47e82525fdcac~mv2.jpg",
            "altText": "Program image alt text"
          },
          "title": "My Awesome New Program",
          "details": "This is a detailed description of my awesome new program."
        },
        "timeline": {
          "selfPaced": true
        },
        "restrictions": {
          "accessType": "PUBLIC"
        },
        "price": {
          "value": "50.00"
        },
        "seo": {
          "slug": "my-awesome-new-program"
        }
      }
    })
  });
  const result = await response.json();
  return result;
})();
```

